      "short": "$\\sqrt{24},\\ \\sqrt{2},\\ \\sqrt{8},\\ \\sqrt{130}$",
      "worked": "$24$, $2$, $8$ and $130$ are not perfect squares, so their square roots are irrational and are surds. The other values are rational: $\\sqrt{25}=5$, $\\sqrt{1}=1$, $\\sqrt{169}=13$ and $\\sqrt[3]{8}=2$.",
